    "definition_raw": "Source Advanced Class Origins pg. 27\nYou feed off the rage of your allies.\n\nPrerequisites: Cha 13, rage class feature.\n\nBenefit: When you are in a rage and an ally with this feat within 60 feet is in a rage, you don’t take the normal –2 penalty to AC for being in a rage. If you would take a larger penalty to AC for being in a rage, reduce that penalty by 2.",
